   "design": "Instruments on the test bench feed data acquisition software, which records the measured channels, so those readings are no longer written on paper and retyped. A report template fills the test setup, equipment list and procedure references from the test plan record, draws tables and plots from the logged data, and marks each result pass or fail against the specification limits by fixed rules. The signed report and raw data are stored under the test ID automatically. Observations, the narrative, checking, signing, sending, discussion and questions stay with the technician.",
